            %h3#EntanglementIslandProposalForBHInformationParadox Entanglement island proposal for BH information paradox
            %h4#claims Claims
            %p
              Claim that the proper application of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+entanglement+entropy"} holographic entanglement entropy
              to the discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bekenstein-Hawking+entropy"} Bekenstein-Hawking entropy
              resolves the apparent
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+hole+information+paradox"} black hole information paradox
              via the appearance of “entanglement islands”:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Geoff+Penington"}> Geoff Penington
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephen+Shenker"} Stephen Shenker
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Stanford"} Douglas Stanford
